  "description": "Run R scripts and render 'Quarto', 'R Markdown' and 'bookdown' documents in a configured order. Record file hashes for each version of an analysis, archive its inputs and outputs locally or in 'GitHub' releases, and restore the inputs for a checked-out version.",
